---
/* Rich body for the "Leading and managing a design system" case
   study. A 2-minute, decision-led read: context, three decisions, the
   result. Optional detail sits behind CaseDetail expanders. The shared
   [slug].astro template renders this when the slug matches and passes
   the summary through the slot.
   Shared .rwc-* layout/typography lives in global.css; image
   lightbox in CaseBodyLightbox.astro. */
import CaseBodyLightbox from './CaseBodyLightbox.astro';
import CaseDetail from './CaseDetail.astro';
import CaseReadBar from './CaseReadBar.astro';
---

<div class="rwc-body">

  {/* HERO */}
  <section class="rwc-hero" id="case-context">
    <div class="rwc-hero-left">
      <div class="case-cat" data-pt={'Caso de estudo · Design system da StreamYard'}>Case study · StreamYard Design System</div>
      <h1 class="case-title" data-pt={'Liderar e gerir um design system'}>Leading and managing a design system</h1>
      <p class="case-subtitle" data-pt={'Liderar um design system em seis equipas de produto da StreamYard para voltar a alinhar o Figma e o código, até a venda da empresa parar o projeto.'}>
        Leading a design system across six StreamYard product teams to bring
        Figma and code back in line, until the company's sale halted the project.
      </p>
      <dl class="rwc-aside rwc-facts">
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Função'}>Role</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Lead designer e gestor do design system'}>Lead designer and design system manager</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Responsabilidades'}>Responsibilities</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Gestor do design system, co-gestor de projeto, revisor de código front-end'}>Design system manager, co-project manager, front-end code reviewer</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Equipa'}>Team</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'2 design leads, 6 designers, 7 engenheiros de 6 equipas de produto, 1 engineering manager'}>2 design leads, 6 designers, 7 engineers from 6 product teams, 1 engineering manager</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Duração'}>Duration</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'10 meses'}>10 months</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="rwc-hero-right">
      <div class="case-img-ph rwc-hero-img is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/hero.webp" alt="StreamYard design system planning overview" data-pt-alt="Visão geral do planeamento do design system da StreamYard" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Summary, passed in from [slug].astro */}
  <slot />

  <CaseReadBar minutes={3} />

  {/* CONTEXT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-challenge">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Contexto'}>Context</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Os designs e o código tinham-se afastado'}>Designs and code had drifted apart</h2>
    <p data-pt={'Os designs e o código construído a partir deles não coincidiam. Alguns componentes existiam em cinco ou mais versões, os designers refaziam componentes porque as dimensões e os espaçamentos estavam errados, e os engenheiros reconstruíam ou ajustavam o que já existia. Uma auditoria à utilização dos componentes mostrou a dimensão do problema. O produto já era grande e estava online, não havia nada montado no Figma, e a equipa de design estava no limite da capacidade, sem orçamento para crescer.'}>
      Designs and the code built from them didn't match. Some components existed
      in five or more variations, designers kept redoing components because
      dimensions and spacing were off, and engineers kept rebuilding or adjusting
      what already existed. An audit of component usage showed the scale of the
      problem. The product was already large and live, there was nothing set up
      in Figma, and the design team was at full capacity with no budget to grow.
    </p>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 1 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-organizing">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 1'}>Decision 1</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Um modelo de contribuição, não uma equipa central'}>A contribution model, not a central team</h2>
    <p data-pt={'Sem orçamento para uma equipa dedicada, o sistema tinha de ser construído por designers e engenheiros de seis equipas de produto. Orientei uma série de workshops para acordar um modelo de contribuição: os pontos de controlo por que passa um componente, da ideia à adoção. Passou a fazer parte da documentação de cada componente, para que cada designer visse em que ponto estava a sua proposta.'}>
      With no budget for a dedicated team, the system had to be built by designers
      and engineers from six product teams. I led a series of workshops to agree
      on a contribution model: the checkpoints a component goes through, from idea
      to adoption. It became part of every component's documentation, so each
      designer could see where their proposal stood.
    </p>

    <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-10">
      <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/contribution-model.webp" width="1024" height="527" alt="v2 - Contribution model flow diagram from Figma" data-pt-alt="v2 - Diagrama de fluxo do modelo de contribuição, no Figma" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole is-whole-capped" data-ratio="16-9">
      <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/component-checklist.webp" width="1600" height="1238" alt="Figma Buttons component page with contribution-model checklist embedded in documentation" data-pt-alt="Página do componente Buttons no Figma, com a checklist do modelo de contribuição integrada na documentação" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <p class="case-img-caption" data-pt={'O nosso modelo de contribuição passou a ser uma parte central da documentação dos componentes, em que cada designer tinha pontos de controlo para as suas propostas de componentes e de diretrizes.'}>
      Our contribution model then became a core part of our component
      documentation, where each designer had checkpoints for their
      component and guideline proposals.
    </p>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 2 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-weekly-practice">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 2'}>Decision 2</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Progresso que todos viam'}>Progress everyone could see</h2>
    <p data-pt={'Escrevemos OKRs para os dois ofícios. Os objetivos dos designers eram propostas de componentes e toolkits documentados; os dos engenheiros eram merges de componentes e a adoção nos codebases. Organizei uma sync semanal do design system para os acompanhar, e a adoção era seguida ao lado do trabalho de design e de engenharia, para o progresso se manter visível nos dois lados.'}>
      We wrote OKRs for both crafts. Designers' goals were documented component
      proposals and toolkits; engineers' goals were component merges and adoption
      in the codebases. I hosted a weekly design system sync to track them, and
      adoption was tracked next to design and engineering work so progress stayed
      visible across both.
    </p>

    <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-9">
      <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/progress-board.webp" width="1024" height="652" alt="SY Design System Jira board — components in To Do, In Progress, Ready to Publish, Published, and In Adoption columns" data-pt-alt="Quadro do Jira do design system da SY — componentes nas colunas To Do, In Progress, Ready to Publish, Published e In Adoption" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <CaseDetail label="The goals and the weekly rhythm" labelPt="Os objetivos e o ritmo semanal">
      <div class="lds-trio">
        <div class="rwc-option">
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/team-goals.webp" alt="Team Goals (Q1) in Notion — Build lovable products objective and key results" data-pt-alt="Objetivos da equipa (Q1) no Notion — objetivo “Build lovable products” e resultados-chave" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="rwc-caption" data-pt={'O objetivo “Build lovable products” e os resultados-chave, com 2 resultados-chave. Acompanhado semanalmente.'}>
            "Build lovable products" objective and key results, with 2 key
            results. Tracked weekly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rwc-option">
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/cycle.webp" alt="Four-step design system cycle: Define experience specs, Build and adopt, Adopt and promote, Communicate and evolve" data-pt-alt="Ciclo do design system em quatro passos: definir as especificações da experiência, construir e adotar, adotar e promover, comunicar e evoluir" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rwc-option">
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/slack-sync.webp" alt="DS Leads sync — Slack notes and takeaways from a weekly meeting" data-pt-alt="Sync dos DS Leads — notas e conclusões, no Slack, de uma reunião semanal" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
          <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole is-whole-capped" data-ratio="16-9">
            <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/quarter-status.webp" width="1024" height="814" alt="This quarter status — 8 components to finalize design, 3 to adopt, plus building and adoption lists" data-pt-alt="Estado deste trimestre — 8 componentes para finalizar o design, 3 para adotar, mais as listas de construção e de adoção" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="rwc-caption" data-pt={'Uma vista do trimestre num relance mantinha a liderança e os contribuidores alinhados sobre o que estava a ser finalizado, o que estava em construção e o que estava pronto a adotar.'}>
            A quarter-at-a-glance view kept leadership and contributors aligned
            on what was finishing, what was building, and what was ready to
            adopt.
          </p>
    </CaseDetail>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 3 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-design">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 3'}>Decision 3</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Primeiro os tokens'}>Tokens first</h2>
    <p data-pt={'Começámos pelos tokens de base e depois especificámos cada componente com tudo o que os engenheiros precisavam: cada tipo, variante, tamanho, estado, configuração de ícones, token de espaçamento e orientação de uso. Os tokens e as variáveis com âmbito definido permitiram mudar o tema inteiro entre claro e escuro com uma só definição.'}>
      We started with foundational tokens, then specified each component with
      everything engineers needed: every type, variant, size, state, icon
      configuration, spacing token and usage guideline. Tokens and scoped
      variables meant the whole theme could switch between light and dark with
      one setting.
    </p>

    <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-9">
      <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/button-spec.webp" width="1024" height="640" alt="Button component specification — spacing rules and usage guidance, light and dark variants side-by-side" data-pt-alt="Especificação do componente botão — regras de espaçamento e orientações de uso, variantes clara e escura lado a lado" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <CaseDetail label="The colour tokens" labelPt="Os tokens de cor">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole is-whole-capped" data-ratio="4-3" style="max-width:700px">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-ds/color-tokens.webp" width="700" height="1024" alt="Color token table in Figma — neutral, primary, status with mapped light and dark values" data-pt-alt="Tabela de tokens de cor no Figma — neutral, primary e status, com os valores mapeados para claro e escuro" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </CaseDetail>
  </section>

  {/* RESULT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-impact">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Resultado'}>Result</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Seis equipas num só roadmap, até a venda o parar'}>Six teams on one roadmap, until the sale stopped it</h2>

    <div class="rwc-stats">
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">6</div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Equipas de produto unidas numa única equipa e num único roadmap de design system.'}>
          Product teams united into a single DS team and roadmap.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">15<span class="rwc-stat-unit">+</span></div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Componentes desenhados e documentados.'}>
          Components designed and documented.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">3</div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Melhorias centrais no produto: WCAG AA*, modo escuro (a caminho), sincronização design-código*. <em>* parcial.</em>'}>
          Core product improvements: WCAG AA*, Dark mode (upcoming),
          Design-to-code sync*. <em>* partial.</em>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p data-pt={'O projeto parou cedo, quando a empresa-mãe foi vendida. Nessa altura, a implementação parcial já tinha reduzido o trabalho repetido de designers e engenheiros de front-end e tornado o produto mais consistente.'}>
      The project stopped early when our parent company was sold. By then the
      partial rollout had already cut repeated work for designers and front-end
      engineers and made the product more consistent.
    </p>
  </section>

</div>

<CaseBodyLightbox />

<style>
  /* LDS-specific overrides — shared .rwc-* layout/typography lives
     in global.css and the lightbox in CaseBodyLightbox.astro. */

  /* Stats descriptions use a slightly wider measure here than the
     default 28ch. */
  .rwc-stat-desc { max-width: 32ch; }
  .rwc-stat-desc em { font-style: italic; opacity: 0.75; }

  /* Goals / cycle / weekly sync: one row of three equal tiles. */
  .lds-trio {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--dimension-space-20);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: var(--dimension-space-24);
    margin-bottom: var(--dimension-space-24);
  }
  .lds-trio .rwc-option .case-img-ph { margin-bottom: var(--dimension-space-8); }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .lds-trio { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
